// (v2-emitter-producer-provenance). Acceptances on main: 17 ever, one since September. The private plan's undated
// effort numbers for the whole v2 program sum to 39 active days, more than ten times below what one node consumed.
// Every row below assumes the acceptance process is fixed first and the per-name waves are replaced by generator
